  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.36 - Browser model cache (OpfsModelCache): a download is stored as part files committed as they fill, so an interrupted download (closed browser, crash, reload) continues after its last committed part instead of starting over, and no multi-GB swap file is left on disk; swap files left by earlier versions are removed when the cache opens. Before: an interrupted 6.4 GB download restarted from byte 0 and its bytes stayed on disk. OpenOrDownloadAsync / OpenCachedAsync return Stream (were OPFSStream). Entries of earlier versions stay readable.",
